  "version": "0.8.0-alpha.3",
  "notes": "## 0.8.0-alpha.3 - 2026-05-11\n\n### Features\n\n- Make mobile companion setup faster by letting first-time device adding enable local mobile sync and continue without restarting the app.\n- Apply mobile sync listener setting changes immediately, including port changes, without asking users to restart.\n- Improve Linux clipboard support on X11, including large clipboard content and rapid clipboard changes.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Prevent repeated synced clipboard content from being applied more than once when a device quickly sends the same content again.\n- Reduce repeated clipboard write failures when another app temporarily blocks clipboard access on Windows.\n- Show mobile sync listener start failures immediately so users are not sent into device pairing when the local listener is unavailable.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.8.0-alpha.3 - 2026-05-11\n\n### Features\n\n- 首次添加移动设备时可直接启用本地移动同步并继续操作，不再需要重启应用。\n- 移动同步监听设置会立即生效，包括端口变更，不再要求用户重启。\n- 改进 Linux X11 下的剪贴板支持，包括大内容和快速连续剪贴板变化。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 避免设备快速重复发送相同内容时，同步剪贴板内容被重复应用。\n- 降低 Windows 上其他应用临时占用剪贴板时反复写入失败的问题。\n- 移动同步监听启动失败时会立即提示，避免在本地监听不可用时继续进入设备配对流程。",
